PROJECT_GOALS.md

# Never copy env files into the image.
#
# The old list only excluded `.env*.local`, which does not match
# `.env.production` — so the live GEMINI_API_KEY was being baked into every
# image layer. Anyone who could pull the image had the key, and deleting the
# file later would not remove it from the earlier layers.
#
# The public Firebase web config comes in as build args instead (see Dockerfile);
# the Gemini key is supplied at runtime by the platform.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local scratch
.firebase
*.md
